<p>My third SCP! Let's hope I can break my trend of low-rated pages with this one.</p>
<p>With this page, I hope to do something that isn't much done around here. Instead of having a really intriguing and complex concept with simple execution, I did a fairly simple concept with a (hopefully) intriguing and solid execution. I hope I accomplished my goal, or something similar.</p>
<p>Also yay, I'm an author now! (even if this skyrockets down, I'll be one for at most two days :p)</p>
<p><strong>Image Credits:</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/98640399@N08/9290203238">https://www.flickr.com/photos/98640399@N08/9290203238</a></p>
<p>Thanks to all of the critiques that lead me through this mess in the draft stages, especially <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3440103); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3440103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1521254905" alt="Captain Kirby" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3440103)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3440103); return false;">Captain Kirby</a></span>, who helped me out numerous times through several major revisions, and helped me get this on track.</p>

